<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us - Food Waster</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/main.css" />
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-800 font-sans">

    <header class="bg-white shadow-md p-4 flex justify-between items-center slide-up" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
        <a href="/" class="inline-block cursor-pointer hover:opacity-80 transition">
            <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-600">Food Waster</h1>
        </a>
        <nav class="space-x-6 font-semibold">
            <a href="/" class="text-gray-500 hover:text-green-600 transition">Dashboard</a>
            <a href="/upload" class="text-gray-500 hover:text-green-600 transition">Upload</a>
            <a href="/about" class="text-green-600 border-b-2 border-green-600 pb-1">About</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="p-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-8">

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm slide-up" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800">About Food Waster</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-500 mt-2 text-lg">Intelligent forecasting for a sustainable future.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-green-600 text-white p-10 rounded-xl shadow-md text-center slide-up" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 uppercase tracking-wider text-green-100">Our Mission</h3>
            <p class="text-xl font-medium leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                To empower grocery retailers with intelligent, data-driven tools that maximize profitability while completely eradicating preventable food waste.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- NEW: Exigence (Urgency & Scale of the Problem) Section -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 slide-up" style="animation-delay: 0.35s;">
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm border-l-4 border-red-500 flex flex-col justify-center">
                <h4 class="text-4xl font-black text-gray-800 mb-2">1.3B</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-600 font-medium text-sm">Tons of food wasted globally every single year.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm border-l-4 border-orange-500 flex flex-col justify-center">
                <h4 class="text-4xl font-black text-gray-800 mb-2">10%</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-600 font-medium text-sm">Of global greenhouse gas emissions come from unconsumed food.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500 flex flex-col justify-center">
                <h4 class="text-4xl font-black text-gray-800 mb-2">$16B+</h4>
                <p class="text-gray-600 font-medium text-sm">Lost annually by US grocery retailers due directly to spoilage.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 slide-up" style="animation-delay: 0.4s;">
            
            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border-t-4 border-red-500 flex flex-col h-full">
                <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
                    <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-red-500 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path></svg>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800">The Breaking Point</h3>
                </div>
                <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                    Grocery supply chains are operating on outdated guesswork. Retailers consistently over-order to ensure fully stocked shelves, leading to massive financial hemorrhaging when perishables expire. This systemic inefficiency doesn't just hurt the bottom line—it accelerates environmental degradation by filling landfills with rotting organic matter that releases potent methane gas. The status quo is economically and ecologically unsustainable.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm border-t-4 border-blue-500 flex flex-col h-full">
                <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
                    <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-blue-500 mr-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"></path></svg>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800">Our Intervention</h3>
                </div>
                <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                    We replace intuition with ruthless precision. By deploying cutting-edge machine learning and predictive analytics, we forecast exact inventory needs based on historical sales, local weather, and micro-seasonal trends. Our platform dictates exactly what to order and when—allowing retailers to intercept waste before it ever enters the supply chain, drastically cutting costs and neutralizing their carbon footprint.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- NEW: The Impact Section -->
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-green-800 to-emerald-900 text-white p-10 rounded-xl shadow-lg slide-up" style="animation-delay: 0.45s;">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-green-50 text-center border-b border-green-700 pb-4">The Real-World Impact</h3>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mt-6">
                <div class="flex items-start">
                    <div class="bg-green-700/50 p-3 rounded-lg mr-4 border border-green-600">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-green-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3.055 11H5a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 002 2 2 2 0 012 2v2.945M8 3.935V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0010.5 8h.5a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 104 0 2 2 0 012-2h1.064M15 20.488V18a2 2 0 012-2h3.064M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="text-lg font-bold">Ecological Preservation</h4>
                        <p class="text-green-200 text-sm mt-1 leading-relaxed">By preventing over-purchasing at the source, we directly cut methane emissions from landfills and conserve the millions of gallons of fresh water used to grow surplus crops that would otherwise be discarded.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-start">
                    <div class="bg-green-700/50 p-3 rounded-lg mr-4 border border-green-600">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-green-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="text-lg font-bold">Economic Optimization</h4>
                        <p class="text-green-200 text-sm mt-1 leading-relaxed">Shrinking the gap between ordering volume and actual consumer demand allows grocers to operate on wider margins. This saved capital can be redirected to lowering consumer prices and paying staff higher wages.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- How It Works Section -->
        <div class="bg-white p-10 rounded-xl shadow-sm slide-up" style="animation-delay: 0.5s;">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-8 text-center border-b pb-4">How It Works</h3>
            
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <!-- Step 1 -->
                <div class="text-center group">
                    <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gray-50 border-2 border-gray-100 group-hover:border-blue-500 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors text-gray-400 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-3xl font-bold shadow-sm">
                        1
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800">Upload Data</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                        Securely upload your store's daily sales history and inventory spreadsheets using our intuitive drag-and-drop interface.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Step 2 -->
                <div class="text-center group">
                    <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gray-50 border-2 border-gray-100 group-hover:border-purple-500 group-hover:text-purple-600 transition-colors text-gray-400 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-3xl font-bold shadow-sm">
                        2
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800">AI Analysis</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                        Our robust machine learning models process your data alongside external factors like upcoming holidays and community events.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Step 3 -->
                <div class="text-center group">
                    <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gray-50 border-2 border-gray-100 group-hover:border-green-500 group-hover:text-green-600 transition-colors text-gray-400 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-3xl font-bold shadow-sm">
                        3
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800">Personalized Report</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                        Instantly receive a perfectly optimized purchasing order report. Download it as a CSV and integrate it directly into your supply chain.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tech Stack Section -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-xl shadow-sm slide-up" style="animation-delay: 0.6s;">
            <div class="text-center mb-8">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800">Advanced Technology Stack</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-1">Built with cutting-edge machine learning pipelines, time-series databases, and web APIs.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
                
                <!-- Category 1: Frontend -->
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 12a9 9 0 01-9 9m9-9a9 9 0 00-9-9m9 9H3m9 9a9 9 0 01-9-9m9 9c1.657 0 3-4.03 3-9s-1.343-9-3-9m0 18c-1.657 0-3-4.03-3-9s1.343-9 3-9m-9 9a9 9 0 019-9"></path></svg>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-800">Frontend</h4>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 w-full">
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 border border-blue-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">React 19</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 border border-blue-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">TypeScript</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 border border-blue-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">Vite</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 border border-blue-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">Tailwind CSS</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 border border-blue-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">Recharts</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 border border-blue-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">EJS Templates</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 border border-blue-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">REST Client</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Category 2: AI & Machine Learning -->
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-800">AI & ML</h4>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 w-full">
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">XGBoost 3.4</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">Gemini Flash</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">ElevenLabs</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">pandas & NumPy</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">SciPy Math</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">scikit-learn</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">Backboard AI</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Category 3: Backend & Data -->
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 7v10c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4V7M4 7c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4M4 7c0-2.21 3.582-4 8-4s8 2.21 8 4m0 5c0 2.21-3.582 4-8 4s-8-1.79-8-4"></path></svg>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-800">Backend & Data</h4>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 w-full">
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 border border-purple-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">Python 3.14</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 border border-purple-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">FastAPI</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 border border-purple-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">TimescaleDB</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 border border-purple-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">PostgreSQL</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 border border-purple-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">MongoDB Atlas</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 border border-purple-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">SQLAlchemy 2</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-purple-50 text-purple-700 border border-purple-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">Pydantic</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Category 4: DevOps & Tools -->
                <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.065 2.572c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.572 1.065c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065-2.572c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 001.066-2.573c-.94-1.543.826-3.31 2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path></svg>
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-800">DevOps & Tools</h4>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 w-full">
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">Docker</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">Docker Compose</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">Vultr Cloud</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">pytest (35 Tests)</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">Open-Meteo API</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">PyArrow / Parquet</span>
                        <span class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-200 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold">Git & Cursor</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>

    </main>

</body>
</html>